duplicative counts.  State v. Ali , 2025 ME 30, ¶¶ 1,  24, 334 A.3d 657 .  Ali now 
argues that the court erred on remand because it effectively imposed the same 
sentence without undertaking a new sentencing analysis.   We agree, and we 
accordingly vacate the judgment again.   
