(Class D), 17 -A M.R.S. § 806 (1)(A) (2026) (Count 4).   The court entered a 
judgment of conviction on all counts, sentencing Ali to fifteen years ’ 
imprisonment with all but seven years suspended and four years of probation  
on Count 1 and concurrent sentences on the remaining counts. 
